    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3babcb50_b861eb67",
        "filename": "drivers/virt/coco/pkvm-guest/arm-pkvm-guest.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 120,
      "author": {
        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-20T16:14:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Imagine that we have a 4k guest running on a 16k host. If the guest wants to relinquish a single 4k page to the host, it will call `page_relinquish(page)`. We\u0027ll then relinquish a 16k region, so 3 additional 4k pages will be relininquished which will result in data loss when they are poisoned by the hypervisor.",
      "parentUuid": "4d520ed7_f5512253",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 120,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 120,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "f3904405998322f2cca71bb27bf3751273426fa9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2d26951a_1e853ca9",
        "filename": "drivers/virt/coco/pkvm-guest/arm-pkvm-guest.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 120,
      "author": {
        "id": 1942270
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-20T16:35:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Page relinquish is called only by balooning and we didn\u0027t support ballooning in this configuration.",
      "parentUuid": "3babcb50_b861eb67",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 120,
        "startChar": 10,
        "endLine": 120,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "f3904405998322f2cca71bb27bf3751273426fa9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3fa004b6_9d0e934a",
